{"4088480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ChimpUP!", "steam_appid": 4088480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChimpUP! is a chaotic co-op movement focused party game where you and your friends race and play minigames. Armed with two independent grapple hooks for arms, you and up to three other chimp friends compete in races across a variety of fast paced maps. Master the swing action, collect the bananas and satisfy your urge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACE TO THE BANANA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is Everything! Compete against your friends in rapid-fire races where every map has a weird gimmick. Finish first to earn points, then immediately launch into the next course without missing a beat. First chimp to reach the target score claims victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/f1160bbc24d70c13cdcdc91422def034.poster.avif?t=1783941622\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/f1160bbc24d70c13cdcdc91422def034.webm?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/f1160bbc24d70c13cdcdc91422def034.mp4?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOUBLE GRAPPLE HOOK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Arms, Infinite Possibilities: Each of your arms is an independent grappling hook, giving you complete control over your climbing style. Alternate between arms for steady climbing, or use both simultaneously for explosive momentum swings. The maps are your playground, it's up to you to master the technique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/cd7554b8237f8f43f44fec4d78a0e919.poster.avif?t=1783941622\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/cd7554b8237f8f43f44fec4d78a0e919.webm?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/cd7554b8237f8f43f44fec4d78a0e919.mp4?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY MINIGAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle with your friends in a fast paced movement based deatmatch minigame! Or pass the bomb to someone else before the timer runs out in the exploding heads minigame!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/4a47715fc2e68740e1fa0e2ad63b4033.poster.avif?t=1783941622\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/4a47715fc2e68740e1fa0e2ad63b4033.webm?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/4a47715fc2e68740e1fa0e2ad63b4033.mp4?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SABOTAGE YOUR FRIENDS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All's Fair in Chimp Racing: Why climb fair when you can climb dirty? Grab your friends mid-swing to throw them off course, or knock them loose at the worst possible moment. Be a nightmare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/e33e44fc1cb1c90f4e6cf589b41049e2.poster.avif?t=1783941622\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/e33e44fc1cb1c90f4e6cf589b41049e2.webm?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/e33e44fc1cb1c90f4e6cf589b41049e2.mp4?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPRESS YOURSELF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your chimp with unique cosmetics and create your own identity on the mountain. Even if you can’t collect any bananas, make sure you outshine them all with fashion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/afbeb906795a29a1bbd954d280fe6952.poster.avif?t=1783941622\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/afbeb906795a29a1bbd954d280fe6952.webm?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/afbeb906795a29a1bbd954d280fe6952.mp4?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IN-GAME COSMETIC AND MAP EDITOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design custom maps with unique challenges and gimmicks, or craft original cosmetics to share with the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/dce88dbc62ec4ea274ea59ac936a20f7.poster.avif?t=1783941622\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/dce88dbc62ec4ea274ea59ac936a20f7.webm?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/dce88dbc62ec4ea274ea59ac936a20f7.mp4?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not into competition? You can tweak the game settings all you want, from chill solo climbing sessions to custom rule sets with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/378fa62929a1ff4c4af2bfeab9067c75.poster.avif?t=1783941622\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/378fa62929a1ff4c4af2bfeab9067c75.webm?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/378fa62929a1ff4c4af2bfeab9067c75.mp4?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player competitive co-op racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathmatch, Exploding Heads (Hot potato) and Speedrun Minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dual independent grapple hook controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-second average map completion for fast-paced action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score-based competition across multiple maps per session</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player grabbing and sabotage mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Steam Workshop integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game map creation tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game cosmetic creation tools</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed race settings for customized play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op and offline single player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless community-created content (yet to be made!)</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChimpUP! is a chaotic co-op movement focused party game where you and your friends race and play minigames. Armed with two independent grapple hooks for arms, you and up to three other chimp friends compete in races across a variety of fast paced maps. Master the swing action, collect the bananas and satisfy your urge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACE TO THE BANANA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is Everything! Compete against your friends in rapid-fire races where every map has a weird gimmick. Finish first to earn points, then immediately launch into the next course without missing a beat. First chimp to reach the target score claims victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/f1160bbc24d70c13cdcdc91422def034.poster.avif?t=1783941622\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/f1160bbc24d70c13cdcdc91422def034.webm?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088480/extras/f1160bbc24d70c13cdcdc91422def034.mp4?t=1783941622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap